<details class="stage" id="stage-{{ stage[0] }}">
<summary>Full analysis stage {{ stage[0] }} · {{ stage[1] }}</summary>
<p>Use the final block in the practical to replay this stage in a working copy. The commands below also work from the original individual workshop project.</p>
<p><strong>Requires</strong> {{ stage[2] }}</p>
{% for file in course.stageFiles %}
{% if file.startsWith(stage[0]) %}<p><a href="code/{{ course.id }}/scripts/{{ file }}" download>Download {{ file }}</a></p>{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
<pre><code>check_project("{{ stage[0] }}")
# Run only after preflight passes.
run_project("{{ stage[0] }}")</code></pre>
<p><strong>Outputs</strong> <code>{{ stage[3] }}</code>. Read the Console for the full path to the stage log.</p>
<p>{{ stage[4] }}</p>
</details>
